WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:07.360
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Japanese youth comedy drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Flying Colors”. Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.800
Sayaka Kudo is in middle school but has no&nbsp;
friends. She is socially anxious and often&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.720
bullied by her classmates. She has two younger&nbsp;
siblings; brother Ryuta and sister Mayumi. Her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:34.240
father only focuses on Ryuta who he thinks will&nbsp;
one day become a baseball superstar. The sisters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:39.120
are often left alone with their mother who takes&nbsp;
great care of them. All of Sayaka’s classmates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:44.560
have a dream in life. She, however, wants to do&nbsp;
nothing. Because of her lack of ambition, she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:50.080
not good at studies either. One day, Sayaka gets&nbsp;
hit on her head with a ball in the playground.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:54.320
Her mother is called by the principal and told&nbsp;
that they cannot teach someone like Sayaka&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:59.200
in the school. The teachers think she is suffering&nbsp;
from some kind of mental illness and needs to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:04.640
to a special school. Sayaka’s mother begs them to&nbsp;
give her daughter a second chance but her words&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:09.920
go to waste as the principal dismisses her.
While returning home, Sayaka sees two schoolgirls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:15.520
walk past them. She comments that their uniform is&nbsp;
pretty and hence is admitted to the same school.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:19.840
Sayaka is nervous on her first day of school,&nbsp;
scared that the new classmates will bully her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:25.520
like the old ones. But to her surprise, everyone&nbsp;
is nice to her, especially a group of three girls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.720
who befriend her instantly. They make her fold her&nbsp;
skirt to make it shorter so it would look better.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:35.440
They also do her makeup and hair in the&nbsp;
washroom and welcome her to their group. 
&nbsp;

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:40.640
As the girls grow up, they transform into&nbsp;
gyaru, a person who follows western traditions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:45.760
typically dyes their hair blonde, and wears&nbsp;
revealing clothes. They frequently dress up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:51.200
party, drink, and smoke, completely disregarding&nbsp;
their studies. Their homeroom teacher Mr.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:56.480
Nishimura scolds them every day and believes&nbsp;
that they will certainly not get into college.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:01.840
Most days, Sayaka returns home in the morning when&nbsp;
her father and brother are exercising outside the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:06.720
house. The relationship between her and her&nbsp;
father has become non-existent with time. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:12.080
only talks to her when he has to scold her while&nbsp;
she ignores him entirely. Her mother, however,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:17.360
is always on her side and supports her, even&nbsp;
though she doesn’t understand her lifestyle.
&nbsp;

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:23.440
Sayaka’s life changes on the first day of&nbsp;
sophomore year. That is when Mr. Nishimura&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:27.840
discovers a hidden packet of cigarettes in&nbsp;
her school bag. She is immediately sent to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.560
the principal’s office to face the repercussions&nbsp;
of her action. Her mother is called and briefed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:36.960
about all of Sayaka’s shenanigans. She begs&nbsp;
the principal to let her daughter stay,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:41.280
arguing that the school’s job is to teach its&nbsp;
weakest students, not profit off the smartest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:47.280
ones. On her repeated request, they agree to&nbsp;
let Sayaka off with a month of suspension. 
&nbsp;

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:52.560
Since Sayaka has all the time in her hands, she&nbsp;
dyes her hair blond. Her mother suggests she try&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:57.760
to get into a university. She genuinely believes&nbsp;
that if Sayaka tries, she can do it. To prepare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:02.880
her for her university entrance examination,&nbsp;
Ms. Kudo sends her to Seiho Cram School.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:08.320
The teacher Tsubota is shocked to see someone&nbsp;
like Sayaka interested in being tutored by him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:13.600
He motivates her and takes on the challenge to&nbsp;
help her enter Keio University. It is considered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:19.040
one of the most prestigious and difficult to enter&nbsp;
universities in Japan which makes Sayaka laugh at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:23.600
the thought that someone like her can be selected.&nbsp;
To check the level of her academics, Tsubota&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:29.360
makes her take a test. Sayaka scores zero out of&nbsp;
hundred but the teacher is still impressed because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:33.920
she answered all the questions, when any other&nbsp;
student would have given up at that point.
&nbsp;

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:38.720
After evaluating her academics, he declares&nbsp;
that her knowledge is comparable to a grade four&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:43.200
student. Hence, he starts from the beginning,&nbsp;
teaching her the syllabus from middle school.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:47.760
The next day, Sayaka goes to a restaurant&nbsp;
with her friends but studies the entire time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:52.800
The girls are shocked and happy at the same&nbsp;
time that she is working hard for something.
&nbsp;

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:57.920
After studying in the cram school for a week, she&nbsp;
scores five out of hundred for the first time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:02.320
Tsubota is happy about the result and&nbsp;
urges her to work even harder. He is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:07.120
great teacher to all of his students. He never&nbsp;
makes them feel dumb for not knowing something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:12.240
and does his best to keep their spirit&nbsp;
up. However, with Sayaka, he struggles a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:17.440
lot because she doesn’t even know simple things&nbsp;
like the north is always opposite to the south.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:23.040
Sayaka’s father refuses to pay for her cram class&nbsp;
because it is too expensive. Moreover, he doesn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:28.000
believe that she can ever get into a university.&nbsp;
Her mother, on the other hand, is determined to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.360
work harder and pay for Sayaka’s tuition. 
One day while Sayaka is studying in the cram&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:40.000
school, a mother drags her son Reiji inside. He&nbsp;
is also a gyaru like Sayaka and is uninterested&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.480
in studying. Reiji’s parents are lawyers&nbsp;
and want him to take the same profession&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:50.640
but he is only interested in playing video games.&nbsp;
Tsubota asks him if he knows what revenge play is.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:55.280
This piques Reiji’s interest and he starts&nbsp;
to study hard to get into law school and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.280 --> 00:05:01.440
teach his father a lesson. As days pass by, Sayaka&nbsp;
makes significant progress but Tsubota wants to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:05.840
accelerate it. Hence, he finds an interesting&nbsp;
way to teach her. He makes her take off a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:10.640
layer of makeup for every wrong answer. He even&nbsp;
promises to show the students an embarrassing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:15.200
picture from his childhood when Sayaka scores&nbsp;
a hundred in middle school’s English test.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:20.640
Starting that day, Sayaka studies all the time&nbsp;
and eventually gets a perfect score on the test.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:25.600
As promised, Tsubota shows them a picture from&nbsp;
his childhood and tells him how he was an average&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:30.800
student which is why he wants to help them.
Following that, Sayaka dyes her hair black and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:35.920
continues going back to school. When Mr. Nishimura&nbsp;
finds out she is aiming to go to a university,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:39.840
he jokes about dancing naked in the&nbsp;
school’s playground if she succeeds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:45.760
Sayaka challenges him and is even more motivated&nbsp;
after the incident. One day, Sayaka and Reiji are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:51.920
outside a restaurant when they see Tsubota meeting&nbsp;
Mr. Nishimura. It turns out that Mr. Nishimura is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:57.520
also funding the cram classes and doesn’t want&nbsp;
Tsubota to take in weak students like Sayaka.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:02.400
He thinks the class’s reputation is more important&nbsp;
than the student’s future. Tsubota argues that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:07.360
has faith in Sayaka and knows that she will get&nbsp;
into her desired university. Seeing a father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:12.800
figure stand up for her, Sayaka gets teary. 
At home, Ms. Kudo notices that her daughter has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:17.840
grown into a better person since she started to&nbsp;
go to cram classes. The next day, she is called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:23.520
by Tsubota to discuss Sakaya’s progress. He&nbsp;
claims that Sayaka is the fastest learning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:28.480
student he has had but since they do not have much&nbsp;
time before the university entrance examination,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:33.920
she needs to come to cram class six days a week.&nbsp;
This will cost her a lot of money but she pays the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:38.960
school after taking a loan from her relatives.&nbsp;
Sayaka finds out about this from Tsubota&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:43.840
and is saddened that she is causing her mother so&nbsp;
much trouble. One day, her friends invite her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:48.880
a restaurant. Sayaka goes but is busy studying&nbsp;
the entire time. The girls then take her to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:53.760
hot spring and claim that they will only hang&nbsp;
out again after Sayaka’s exams because they know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:59.040
how hard she is studying for it. Sayaka cries&nbsp;
and thanks them for being understanding. 
&nbsp;

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:03.920
A few months later, Sayaka finally upgrades&nbsp;
to the high school syllabus book and has to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:09.440
study how to write an essay. Tsubota gives her&nbsp;
several books and asks her to watch a lot of news.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:14.640
When the syllabus gets tougher, she has a hard&nbsp;
time focusing. She even cuts her hair short to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:19.360
show her resolve. Over the weeks, she studies&nbsp;
so hard that she dozes off during most of her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:24.640
classes at school. One day, Mr. Nishimura&nbsp;
wakes her up by grabbing her by her hair.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:28.320
He calls her mother to tell her that her&nbsp;
daughter hasn’t improved since she was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:34.240
suspended. But Ms. Kudo retaliates that Sayaka&nbsp;
is not the girl she was a few months ago.
&nbsp;

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:40.240
The next day at Cram class, Reiji comes in with&nbsp;
dark hair, glasses, and a completely changed look.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:46.240
On being asked, he says that Sayaka inspired him&nbsp;
to work harder. Following that, Sayaka takes her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:51.040
first mock entrance exam. When the results are&nbsp;
published, she is disappointed to have gotten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:56.480
only sixty out of a hundred when the minimum score&nbsp;
to get into her desired university is seventy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.480 --> 00:08:01.760
Tsubota thinks it is incredible because only some&nbsp;
months ago, she would have scored zero. But Sayaka&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:07.040
is disappointed that all that hard work is still&nbsp;
not enough. She returns home to see her father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:12.480
manhandling her brother Ryuta for saying that he&nbsp;
doesn’t want to play baseball anymore. Ryuta snaps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:17.360
and pushes his father away, shouting that he never&nbsp;
wanted to play baseball in the first place. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:22.880
storms off and doesn’t return home that night.
The following day, Sayaka takes yet another mock&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:28.720
exam but doesn’t score enough. The stress and&nbsp;
sleep deprivation catches up to her and she loses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:34.400
motivation to study. Tsubota tries to motivate&nbsp;
her but his optimism makes her even more furious.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:39.200
She lashes out at him and runs away from the Cram&nbsp;
class. She doesn’t come out of her room for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:45.360
next two days. Then, one night, Ryuta returns&nbsp;
home and informs his father that he has left the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:50.640
school’s baseball team. Ever since Mr. Kudo had to&nbsp;
give up his dream of being a baseball player, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:56.320
had dreamt of making his son the greatest player&nbsp;
of all time. Seeing his dreams crash once again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:02.000
he hits Ryuta, asking him to come back to his&nbsp;
senses. Ms. Kudo gets so frustrated that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:07.280
breaks a vehicle’s window to stop her husband.&nbsp;
When he is distracted, Ryuta takes the opportunity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:12.320
to run away from home again. Ms. Kudo tells&nbsp;
them about a time Ryuta had an asthma attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:16.880
the night before a match because he was scared&nbsp;
he would be scolded if he didn’t perform well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:21.600
She belittles her husband for being an&nbsp;
awful father to all of his children. 
&nbsp;

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:26.800
Later, Sayaka asks her mother to accompany her&nbsp;
on a field trip to Keio University. They visit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:31.680
the university grounds the next day and are amazed&nbsp;
by it. Ms. Kudo wishes that her daughter will have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:37.200
the same lifestyle as the busy students walking&nbsp;
down the hallways. At night, Sayaka goes to cram&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:42.960
class and meets Tsubota. She apologizes for being&nbsp;
rude and thanks him for being patient with her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:48.160
She also promises to continue the classes from&nbsp;
the next day. A week later, Sayaka takes her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:54.000
third mock exam but is too scared to look at the&nbsp;
results. On coming back home, she finds her father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:59.360
burning all the baseball kits that he bought for&nbsp;
Ryuta. He has realized his mistake and wants to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:03.920
be a better father from now onwards. He promises&nbsp;
to support his children with whatever they want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:09.120
to do in life. As the family shares an emotional&nbsp;
moment, Sayaka shows them the recent mock exam&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:13.520
results where she has scored sixty-five. 
Her parents are prouder than they have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:17.600
ever been. Cut to the day of the entrance&nbsp;
examination. The roads are blocked because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:22.800
of heavy snowfall and the bus route is closed.&nbsp;
Sayaka’s father offers to drive her which is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:28.240
surprising because he has never been involved&nbsp;
in her life in the slightest way. On their way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:33.440
he asks her to do her best and not worry about&nbsp;
the tuition fee because he has it managed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:38.160
After dropping her off, he even cheers for his&nbsp;
daughter for the first time in his life.
&nbsp;

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:43.440
Sayaka does her best in the test and returns&nbsp;
home. Later that day, she goes to the cram class,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:48.080
declaring that it is her last day. She doesn’t&nbsp;
want to return to tell him the results,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:52.800
scared that she will disappoint him. She also&nbsp;
makes Tsubota sign her dictionary so he would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:58.080
always be there when she studies. Before leaving,&nbsp;
she hands him a letter, thanking him for believing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:03.040
in her and making her who she is today.
A few days later, she checks the result on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:09.760
the internet, only to find that she didn’t pass.&nbsp;
She calls Tsubota and tells him about the result.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:14.560
Tsubotat doesn’t give up and insists that they&nbsp;
can appeal for her answer sheet to be rechecked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:20.960
under faculty policies. Sayaka gives up and&nbsp;
doesn’t apply for it, so Tsubota does it for her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:24.640
For the next few days, she goes out with&nbsp;
her friends every day, trying to live her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:30.720
old lifestyle but no matter what she does, she&nbsp;
cannot help but feel disappointed. Then, one day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:36.320
she checks the results again, and to her surprise,&nbsp;
sees that she has gotten into Keio University. 
&nbsp;

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:40.880
She immediately cycles to the cram class&nbsp;
and is out of breath when she meets Tsubota.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:46.720
When she tells him she has been accepted, the&nbsp;
entire class erupts into cheers. Both Tsubota and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:52.880
Sayaka can’t help but bawl their eyes out. In the&nbsp;
last montage, we see Mr. Nishimura naked on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.880 --> 00:12:00.560
school grounds, taking pictures with the girls&nbsp;
as he had promised. Sayaka leaves for college&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:04.720
after wishing her parents farewell. 
